{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING: This game contains at least 80% butt puns.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNOPSIS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our non-binary protagonist, adrift in their life, is looking at online influencers to fill the void. They wish they could be more like them...and then, POOF\u2014their wish is granted\u2014but with a <i>slight caveat...</i><br><br>Help them navigate a world filled with peril and problems as they search for purpose and self-love. Make impactful choices and guide our cheeked up hero to save the world... and themselves. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >laugh out loud dialog</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >extremely silly CGs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >three unique endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2,400 words / 15 minute playtime for all endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >copyright-free music that can be livestreamed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for streaming with friends and solo.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Buttastrophe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725510/635d9d1229ca81eb151a41be42da5c03b84dc93b.jpg"},{"name":"No ifs, ands or butts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725510/2b19208c4330bf95c45e96a86c467c48cb355f6a.jpg"},{"name":"Life is Booty-ful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725510/fd0120e2dccff65c076708ea5530b115613fa8d1.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725510?t=1748573836","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725510/df15501b42bc2c99a97694ef3ee9f7235798384b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748573836","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/372551